  "m_6b8d86173396": "Contact {dealerName} to confirm availability, details, and the next step.",
  "m_9dc859e86f2e": "Viewing",
  "m_020b06c2c92e": "Import enquiry demo",
  "m_85b1a0613bcc": "Financing enquiry demo",
  "m_b4acafc27b89": "Trade-in",
  "m_c1f6b6960e2a": "Trade-in enquiry demo",
  "m_2461913363fe": "Example sale vehicles",
  "m_7f63a91b621d": "Example import vehicles",
  "m_8d3906094383": "Demo content",
  "m_1d808dbae1fd": "Sample profiles for a visual preview only. No real showroom staff are represented.",
  "m_fe28e19ec788": "Sample car brands for a visual preview. They do not represent confirmed partnerships.",
  "m_f8bb861ddb38": "What should you check before buying?",
  "m_0075a1282b61": "Confirm the car’s history, documents and mechanical condition directly with the showroom.",
  "m_ae55f588a5e8": "Start with the history and documents",
  "m_ffc19860911c": "Before the visit, ask for the car’s basic details and available service history. Compare the identification details in the documents with those on the car, and note anything that needs to be clarified in person.",
  "m_6061b9ec6dc7": "Inspect the car systematically",
  "m_37bfc63f4201": "Check the bodywork, tyres, interior and main systems, then arrange a test drive. If you are unsure about the mechanical condition, consult an independent specialist before deciding to buy.",
  "m_6c03d52641c2": "How does importing a car work?",
  "m_8a916b367970": "Explore the import demo and the questions to ask about finding a car, transport and registration at your destination. Confirm actual services directly with the showroom.",
  "m_b4e929d8bcfe": "Documents",
  "m_c0d89ac88a6d": "Set clear search requirements",
  "m_2f92bb97963d": "Make and model are only the starting point. Specify the year, engine, equipment, acceptable mileage and total budget, including transport and preparation for registration.",
  "m_8125edd2915f": "Ask for clear records at every step",
  "m_7bb1150a580b": "Before making a commitment, confirm the exact car, what is known about its condition, which documents accompany it and how transport will be arranged. Check the final registration requirements against current official rules.",
  "m_a3bbf7d2d629": "How should you compare finance options?",
  "m_aece968e4e76": "The finance calculator is illustrative. Confirm any actual terms for your chosen car directly with the showroom.",
  "m_55b950a876e4": "Compare the full offer",
  "m_0215461b0d35": "Look beyond the monthly payment to the term, initial payment, total amount payable, fees, insurance and ownership conditions at the end of the agreement.",
  "m_d05e1a182359": "Set a realistic budget",
  "m_2028457881f0": "Allow for registration, servicing and running costs. Ask for a written, individual offer for the specific car before comparing options.",
  "m_7909ad934ee1": "How to find a car",
  "m_61a1f64327cb": "Define your preferred make, body style and budget, then contact the showroom to discuss actual availability.",
  "m_53345fb99676": "Guidance",
  "m_c7f937836f5d": "Choosing a car",
  "m_d60b316436bb": "Start with everyday use",
  "m_1b9317fe82a1": "Think about where you will drive, how many people and how much luggage you usually carry, and which conveniences matter most. This will help you build a shorter, more useful list of suitable models.",
  "m_a2e6e71c9019": "Compare more than the purchase price",
  "m_2425116d8148": "Fuel consumption, servicing, tyres, insurance and expected mileage all affect the real cost of ownership. Choose the best balance for your needs, rather than simply the longest equipment list.",
  "m_e09de315658e": "Confirm a convenient time in advance",
  "m_936e61663661": "Call to confirm showroom visiting hours and a suitable time. Mention the car you want to see and your main questions so the visit can be focused and useful.",
  "m_8cb761a5ea00": "Allow time for a thorough viewing",
  "m_7cfff2c09c8f": "Inspect the car in daylight, try every seat, check the practical details and write down your questions. There is no need to decide before you understand the condition and documents.",
  "m_38327336274a": "Trade-in and valuation",
  "m_506501d617fa": "Try the trade-in enquiry demo, then contact the showroom to ask whether an individual valuation is available.",
  "m_5bb877fcf558": "Prepare accurate car information",
  "m_a7fd2b2e7d75": "The model, year, mileage, equipment, service history and known issues provide a useful starting point. Photos help with an initial discussion but do not replace an in-person inspection.",
  "m_ebc3939a988e": "Consider the valuation as part of the whole deal",
  "m_e668a281d4ed": "The final value depends on the condition, documents and current market demand. Compare both the valuation of your current car and the terms for the car you want to acquire.",
  "m_9bee2e6737a4": "Registration after import",
  "m_0f3e19c54d7c": "Use this guide to prepare questions about the steps after a car arrives. Confirm any actual assistance directly with the showroom.",
  "m_44b3e9b05320": "Organise the available documents",
  "m_e70a71afb2f8": "Gather the car’s origin and purchase documents, along with everything received during transport. Check names, identification details and dates for discrepancies before starting registration.",
  "m_7295d69358c1": "Check the current procedure",
  "m_54a8687bd25c": "Requirements depend on the car and its origin. Confirm the current steps and required original documents with the relevant authorities or your chosen provider, rather than relying on an old online checklist.",
  "m_b234dfd2e473": "What to ask during a viewing",
  "m_5052c73a41c8": "Confirm mileage, history, equipment and availability in person.",
  "m_19bdaa8784a2": "Ask about the history and current condition",
  "m_388cf795620f": "Ask what service information is available, whether there are known repairs or issues, and which consumables were recently replaced. Request specific answers about the car you are considering.",
  "m_948f7d8a636a": "Check the equipment and upcoming costs",
  "m_76c51680f5ba": "Check the features that matter to you in person and ask what is included in the advertised price. Allow for registration, initial servicing, tyres and insurance.",
  "m_dc80eed90c58": "After the purchase",
  "m_b7fe5151778e": "Questions to ask about servicing, documents and next steps after a purchase.",
  "m_fd5dfcd219ca": "Servicing",
  "m_60fc173181f5": "Keep the documents and plan for deadlines",
  "m_e0cd3df2f394": "Organise the agreement, payment documents, service information and everything handed over with the car. Check current registration and insurance deadlines using official sources.",
  "m_32e3982c0af8": "Establish a clear starting point for maintenance",
  "m_ecf22b09cf99": "Record the current mileage and plan an initial technical inspection based on the available history. This helps you schedule the next service using clear information rather than assumptions.",
  "m_18c9b86509cc": "Sedan",
