  "m_bd96fdeb30eb": "Talk to the team",
  "m_85b7e52e1fc2": "Arrange your visit in advance so we can prepare the specific car and allow enough time.",
  "m_97a38845e84e": "Provide a listing or specify a make, model, year and budget. We will then discuss the next steps with you.",
  "m_12d67a47eea6": "Provide a listing or specify a model and budget.",
  "m_bdcf1a5b90dc": "Ask for current terms for your selected car and the specific transaction.",
  "m_d7a5831e8826": "Trade-in and appraisal",
  "m_111bf297828a": "Tell us about the car you would like to offer and request an individual appraisal.",
  "m_fad6f6b05163": "Request an appraisal for a sale or trade-in.",
  "m_8d319146b510": "Sample profiles for a visual preview. The names and photos will be replaced with the real team.",
  "m_cef356a09f1b": "Confirm the history, documents and mechanical condition directly with the team.",
  "m_61d62763706a": "Before the meeting, ask for the basic vehicle details and available service history. Compare the identifiers in the documents with those on the car and note anything that needs clarification in person.",
  "m_f88ad7334276": "Check the bodywork, tyres, interior and main systems, then take a test drive. Consult an independent specialist before buying if you are unsure of the mechanical condition.",
  "m_718682656426": "Discuss sourcing, transport and preparation for registration in Bulgaria.",
  "m_c34bbb09db54": "A make and model are not enough. Specify the year, engine, equipment, acceptable mileage and total budget, including transport and preparation for registration.",
  "m_b00b442cc6fd": "Before committing, confirm the exact vehicle, what is known about its condition, which documents accompany it and how transport will be arranged. Check the final registration requirements against current official rules.",
  "m_9fef04b1b70e": "How to compare financing offers?",
  "m_52776548936d": "Ask about current terms for your selected car.",
  "m_8ad37440f756": "Look beyond the monthly payment: consider the term, initial payment, total amount payable, fees, insurance and ownership terms at the end of the agreement.",
  "m_80301859af37": "Allow for registration, servicing and running costs. Request an individual written offer for the specific car before comparing options.",
  "m_198a58698cea": "How to choose a car",
  "m_2b13bb88ef4e": "Discuss the make, body type and budget with the team based on your requirements.",
  "m_af278c6d7728": "Choosing a car",
  "m_a1df03960270": "Fuel consumption, servicing, tyres, insurance and expected mileage affect the true cost of ownership. Choose the right balance for your needs, not simply the longest equipment list.",
  "m_bb6de49273a3": "Showroom visits are by appointment. Tell us which car you would like to view and your main questions so the meeting is focused and useful.",
  "m_c73ab32761ef": "Allow enough time for a thorough viewing",
  "m_19c11dc2b06e": "Inspect the car in daylight, try every seat, check the practical details and write down your questions. There is no need to decide before clarifying the condition and documents.",
  "m_d6fccee975d0": "Offer a car for trade-in and request an individual appraisal.",
  "m_6d7353ddea1e": "The model, year, mileage, equipment, service history and known issues provide a useful starting point. Photos help an initial conversation but do not replace an in-person inspection.",
  "m_b1162f9ae5b2": "The final value depends on condition, documents and current market demand. Compare both the appraisal of your current car and the terms for the car you want to acquire.",
  "m_6dfab762f8d5": "The team explains the next steps after the car arrives.",
  "m_8074f997b21c": "Collect the vehicle origin and purchase documents, along with everything received during transport. Check names, identifiers and dates for discrepancies before starting registration.",
  "m_ee7c4793c0c6": "Requirements depend on the origin and the specific vehicle. Confirm the current steps and required original documents with the relevant authorities or your chosen provider rather than relying on an old online checklist.",
  "m_b1b2f7bff7d1": "Confirm mileage, history, equipment and availability in person.",
  "m_c0e3e7e79516": "Ask what service information is available, whether there are known repairs or issues and which service items were recently replaced. Request specific answers about the specific car.",
  "m_f10c1f827576": "Check the features that matter to you in person and ask what the advertised price includes. Allow for registration, initial servicing, tyres and insurance.",
  "m_92d77043c14b": "Get in touch about servicing, documents and the next steps after the transaction.",
  "m_d0fc2d0d9cda": "Organise the agreement, payment documents, service information and everything handed over with the car. Check current registration and insurance deadlines with an official source.",
  "m_a11dc1d50728": "Record the current mileage and plan an initial mechanical inspection based on the available history. This makes the next service depend on clear information rather than assumptions.",
  "m_4758b873ee67": "Sportback",
